    <bpmn:process id="W_W3397" name="W3397. Cash-Conversion-Cycle (CCC) Forecasting &amp; Scenario Modeling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly forecast; strategic decision (season, capex, acquisition)
Frequency: Monthly + scenario-driven
Volume: Group + 5-entity
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Treasury Manager, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Merchandising (links to VS-101), Supply (links to VS-02), AR (links to VS-16)
Source: workflow W3397 — Cash-Conversion-Cycle (CCC) Forecasting &amp; Scenario Modeling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3397_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3397_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3397_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3397_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3397_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3397_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3397_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3397_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly forecast; strategic decision (season, capex, acquisition)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3397_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3397_Task4" name="Treasury/FP&amp;A build/maintain the CCC forecast model: project DPO/DIO/DSO from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/FP&amp;A build/maintain the CCC forecast model: project DPO/DIO/DSO from plan + initiatives (W3394–W3396), compute forward DWC and the resulting cash generation/consumption, and integrate to the rolling cash forecast (links to VS-18.1/W233)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3397_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3397_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3397_Task5" name="Treasury model scenarios: seasonal peak (ber-months inventory build per profile…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury model scenarios: seasonal peak (ber-months inventory build per profile §13.2), import-pipeline surge (links to VS-02.2), capex acceleration (links to VS-40), supplier-distress (links to VS-68/VS-02.3), and macro/FX shock (links to VS-18.3); quantify CCC and liquidity impact
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Scenario-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3397_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3397_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3397_Task6" name="Treasury/CFO use the CCC forecast to inform SCF facility sizing (W3377/W3382)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury/CFO use the CCC forecast to inform SCF facility sizing (W3377/W3382), dynamic-discounting throttle (W3389), debt/facility decisions (links to VS-18/W319), and the board cash outlook (links to VS-36); communicate material CCC shifts to executives
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CFO / CEO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3397_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3397_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3397_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
