        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-546 (ensure controlled execution — Working Capital Analytics &amp; Cash-Conversion-Cycle Governance (PA-105.3).) | - operational: monthly actual-vs-forecast variance (W3399); operational: scenario library and stress tests
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
