    <bpmn:process id="W_W3398" name="W3398. Working-Capital Initiative Portfolio, Prioritization &amp; Benefits Realization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DWC target (W3393); quarterly portfolio review
Frequency: Quarterly + continuous intake
Volume: ~20–40 active initiatives
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Treasury Manager, FP&amp;A, initiative owners (Procurement/Merchandising/Supply/AR), CFO
Source: workflow W3398 — Working-Capital Initiative Portfolio, Prioritization &amp; Benefits Realization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3398_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3398_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3398_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3398_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3398_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3398_Lane2" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3398_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3398_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3398_Start4" name="DWC target (W3393); quarterly portfolio review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3398_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3398_Task5" name="Treasury maintain the working-capital initiative portfolio: each initiative…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury maintain the working-capital initiative portfolio: each initiative (DPO term extension, DIO OTB tightening, DSO collection acceleration, process automation, etc.) with owner, expected cash/benefit, cost, timeline, and risk; intake new ideas continuously
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3398_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3398_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3398_Task6" name="Treasury/CFO prioritize the portfolio by benefit-vs-effort and risk, sequence…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/CFO prioritize the portfolio by benefit-vs-effort and risk, sequence into quarterly waves, secure resources (incl. IT links to VS-27/VS-30 automation), and assign executive sponsors; resolve cross-functional conflicts (e.g., DPO vs vendor margin per W3381)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3398_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3398_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3398_Task7" name="FP&amp;A/Treasury track benefits realization: measure actual vs expected cash…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FP&amp;A/Treasury track benefits realization: measure actual vs expected cash release per initiative, attribute DWC movement to specific initiatives, and report realization rate to the executive committee (links to VS-33.2) and board (links to VS-36); retire/close or re-baseline initiatives
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3398_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3398_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3398_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3398_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-546 (ensure controlled execution — Working Capital Analytics &amp; Cash-Conversion-Cycle Governance (PA-105.3).) | - operational: rigorous measurement and attribution; operational: executive sponsorship and quarterly review
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
