    <bpmn:process id="W_W3399" name="W3399. Working-Capital Performance Dashboard &amp; Executive Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly close (links to VS-17.1/W9A); weekly flash
Frequency: Weekly flash + monthly + quarterly
Volume: Group + 5-entity + category/channel
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: Treasury Manager, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), BI (links to VS-28.1), CFO
Source: workflow W3399 — Working-Capital Performance Dashboard &amp; Executive Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3399_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3399_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3399_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3399_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3399_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3399_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3399_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3399_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3399_Start4" name="Monthly close (links to VS-17.1/W9A); weekly flash">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3399_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3399_Task5" name="Treasury/BI publish the working-capital dashboard: DPO/DIO/DSO/DWC actual vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/BI publish the working-capital dashboard: DPO/DIO/DSO/DWC actual vs target vs benchmark, trend and variance, SCF/dynamic-discounting yield (W3388), initiative portfolio status (W3398), and cash-impact bridge; weekly flash + monthly full
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / BI / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Weekly/Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3399_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3399_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3399_Task6" name="Treasury/CFO conduct the monthly working-capital review with Procurement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/CFO conduct the monthly working-capital review with Procurement, Merchandising, Supply, AR, and FP&amp;A: variance to target, initiative progress, risk/issues, and corrective actions; assign owners and SLAs
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / CFO / Owners
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3399_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3399_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3399_Task7" name="CFO report working-capital performance to the executive committee (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO report working-capital performance to the executive committee (links to VS-33.2) and board (links to VS-36); align narrative with the cash forecast (links to VS-18.1) and EBITDA/margin story (links to VS-101.3/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3399_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3399_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3399_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3399_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-546 (ensure controlled execution — Working Capital Analytics &amp; Cash-Conversion-Cycle Governance (PA-105.3).) | - operational: near-real-time data feeds and weekly flash; operational: holistic DWC + margin view (links to VS-101)
Owner: Treasury Manager</bpmn:text>
