    <bpmn:process id="W_W3400" name="W3400. Working-Capital Policy, Governance &amp; Board-Level Cash Discipline" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual policy review; board governance cycle (links to VS-36); audit/ERM review (links to VS-21)
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: 1 policy framework, group-wide
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, Treasury Manager, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Board/Audit Committee (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3400 — Working-Capital Policy, Governance &amp; Board-Level Cash Discipline</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3400_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3400_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3400_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3400_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3400_Lane2" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3400_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3400_Lane3" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3400_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3400_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3400_Start5" name="Annual policy review; board governance cycle (links to VS-36); audit/ERM review (links to…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3400_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3400_Task6" name="Treasury/CFO maintain the working-capital policy: payment-term standards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/CFO maintain the working-capital policy: payment-term standards, SCF/dynamic-discounting authority matrix, DWC/DPO/DIO/DSO governance, receivables-financing limits, inventory-commitment controls (links to VS-101 OTB), and cash-forecast accuracy tolerance; align to the treasury policy (links to VS-18 W322) and risk appetite (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3400_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3400_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3400_Task7" name="Internal Audit/Risk review working-capital controls: SoD over…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Internal Audit/Risk review working-capital controls: SoD over SCF/dynamic-discounting (links to W3384/W3392), term-change authorization, OTB/markdown controls (links to VS-101), accuracy of DWC KPIs, and off-balance-sheet classification (links to W3377); feed findings to remediation
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Risk
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3400_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3400_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3400_Task8" name="CFO report working-capital governance, risk, and performance to the Audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO report working-capital governance, risk, and performance to the Audit Committee/Board (links to VS-36), confirm alignment with the capital/liquidity strategy and EBITDA target, and approve policy updates; ensure disclosure consistency in financial reporting (links to VS-17)
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): Board / Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3400_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3400_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3400_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3400_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-546 (ensure controlled execution — Working Capital Analytics &amp; Cash-Conversion-Cycle Governance (PA-105.3).) | - operational: audit review (links to VS-21) and SoD; operational: single source and audit sign-off
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
